      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my husband had the flu last week and seemed better but today he woke up with a really bad headache and his fever is 103. he's acting kinda weird too, like he's slow to respond when i talk to him... i think it's just the flu hanging on but should i give him more tylenol or is this something else?",
