      "content": "idk i just feel like he's fine he's just exhausted from being sick all week. he's always been a bit out of it when he has a fever. if i give him a double dose of the tylenol it should bring the fever down and he'll sleep it off right? i really dont want to sit in an er for 8 hours if it's just a lingering virus.",
