      "content": "look i know you say go to the er but we stay in a rural area and the hospital is like an hour away and i can barely afford the co-pay right now. he's literally just sleepy and the fever is the main thing. if i just give him some extra ibuprofen with the tylenol it might work faster to break the fever? i really think he just needs to sleep it off and i'll check on him in a few hours. can i just do that?",
